msgid "Nuclear-electronic orbital (NEO) method"
msgstr "核-电子轨道 (NEO) 方法"

msgid ""
"The `Nuclear-electron orbital (NEO) "
"<https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.chemrev.9b00798>`__ method pioneered by Hammes-"
"Schiffer and coworkers is available in ``Molpro`` for (local) density fitted"
" spin-restricted NEO-Hartree-Fock as well as NEO-RKS. It allows to handle a "
"selected number of hydrogen nuclei as quantum particles by building a second"
" Fock-matrix for the latter, coupling both subsystems (electrons and quantum"
" protons) by a Coulomb operator. Further information about the method can be"
" found `here <https://doi.org/10.1021%2Facs.jctc.3c01055>`__."
msgstr ""
"由 Hammes-Schiffer 及其合作者开创的 `核-电子轨道 (NEO) "
"<https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.chemrev.9b00798>`__ 方法已在 ``Molpro`` "
"中实现，可用于（局域）密度拟合自旋限制 NEO-Hartree-Fock 以及 NEO-RKS。该方法通过为选定的氢核（作为量子粒子）构建第二个 "
"Fock 矩阵，并使用 Coulomb 算符耦合两个子系统（电子和量子质子），从而处理这些氢核。关于该方法的更多信息可查阅 `此处 "
"<https://doi.org/10.1021%2Facs.jctc.3c01055>`__\\ 。"

msgid ""
"Currently, all NEO programs require the use of the ``gdirect`` option and "
"are not available with symmetry."
msgstr "目前，所有 NEO 程序都需要使用 ``gdirect`` 选项，并且不支持对称性。"

msgid "Density fitting NEO-Hartree-Fock"
msgstr "密度拟合 NEO-Hartree-Fock"

msgid "Using"
msgstr "使用"

msgid "Local density fitting NEO-Hartree-Fock"
msgstr "局域密度拟合 NEO-Hartree-Fock"

msgid ""
"enables the local density fitting NEO-RHF program. The local density fitting"
" of the electronic subsystem leads to further speed-ups in particular for "
"large molecular systems. The specific parameters for local density fitting "
"can be adjusted with the options given in the `the SCF program#local density"
" fitting Hartree-Fock <the_scf_program.html#local-density-fitting-hartree-"
"fock>`__ section."
msgstr ""
"启用局域密度拟合 NEO-RHF 程序。电子子系统的局域密度拟合可带来进一步的加速，特别是对于大型分子体系。局域密度拟合的具体参数可以通过 `the "
"SCF program#local density fitting Hartree-Fock <the_scf_program.html#local-"
"density-fitting-hartree-fock>`__ 章节中给出的选项进行调整。"

msgid "Density fitting NEO-DFT"
msgstr "密度拟合 NEO-DFT"

msgid ""
"The spin-restricted NEO-DFT program with density fitting for electron-"
"repulsion integrals is available through"
msgstr "用于电子排斥积分的、具有密度拟合功能的自旋限制 NEO-DFT 程序可通过以下方式使用"

msgid ""
"Currently only standard grids are supported (``SG1``, ``SG2`` and ``SG3``). "
"The use of ``SG3`` is recommended for its numerical stability. If no grid is"
" defined, the program defaults to ``SG2`` and issues a warning. The DFT "
"functional for electronic exchange and correlation is defined as an option "
"(*functional*), similar to a regular DFT calculation. However, in the case "
"of NEO-DFT one also requires the definition of an electron-proton "
"correlation (epc) functional (*epc-functional*). The program currently "
"supports ``epc17.1``, ``epc17.2``, ``epc18.1`` and ``epc18.2``, as provided "
"through the libxc library. We recommend the use of the epc17.2 functional "
"for NEO-DFT calculations in general."
msgstr ""
"目前仅支持标准格点（\\ ``SG1``\\ 、\\ ``SG2`` 和 ``SG3``\\ ）。推荐使用 ``SG3`` "
"以获得其数值稳定性。如果未定义格点，程序将默认使用 ``SG2`` 并发出警告。用于电子交换与关联的 DFT 泛函被定义为一个选项（\\ "
"*functional*\\ ），类似于常规的 DFT 计算。然而，在 NEO-DFT 的情况下，还需要定义一个电子-质子关联（epc）泛函（\\ "
"*epc-functional*\\ ）。该程序目前支持通过 libxc 库提供的 ``epc17.1``\\ 、\\ ``epc17.2``\\ "
"、\\ ``epc18.1`` 和 ``epc18.2``\\ 。我们通常推荐在 NEO-DFT 计算中使用 epc17.2 泛函。"

msgid ""
"The definition of the quantum nuclei as well as the thresholds for the "
"convergence of the nuclear cycles follows the same procedure as NEO-HF."
msgstr "量子核的定义以及核循环收敛的阈值遵循与 NEO-HF 相同的程序。"

msgid "NEO specific options"
msgstr "NEO 特定选项"

msgid "Basis sets"
msgstr "基组"

msgid ""
"The basis definition for NEO calculations must be given accordingly to the "
"following basis block layout"
msgstr "NEO 计算的基组定义必须按照以下基组块布局给出"

msgid ""
"The electronic basis set can be freely chosen from the Molpro basis set "
"library. At the current stage no user defined mixed basis sets are possible "
"within the NEO programs."
msgstr "电子基组可以从 Molpro 基组库中自由选择。在当前阶段，NEO 程序中不允许用户自定义混合基组。"

msgid ""
"The nuclear basis set is defined via the ``nucbas`` keyword. The default "
"basis for nuclear basis sets must be defined in every case as the ``neo-"
"basis``. Afterwards, the selected NEO centers can be assigned with the "
"desired basis set. It is highly recommended to use the specifically tailored"
" `PB basis sets <https://doi.org/10.1063/5.0009233>`__ for multicomponent "
"methods developed by Hammes-Schiffer and coworkers. Note that all NEO "
"centers need to be assigned individually with the same basis set."
msgstr ""
"核基组通过 ``nucbas`` 关键词定义。核基组的默认基组在任何情况下都必须定义为 ``neo-basis``\\ 。之后，选定的 NEO "
"中心可以被分配所需的基组。强烈建议使用由 Hammes-Schiffer 及其同事为多组分方法专门定制的 `PB 基组 "
"<https://doi.org/10.1063/5.0009233>`__\\ 。请注意，所有 NEO 中心都需要单独分配相同的基组。"

msgid ""
"The density fitting basis for the nuclear subsystem is defined via the "
"``nucfit`` keyword. In order to avoid issues in basis set assignments for "
"the classical nuclei, the default basis must be assigned as the ``neo-"
"basis``. Afterwards all NEO centers must be assigned the same fitting basis "
"set (two have been included in the basis library), or a new set must be "
"defined. For the fitting of the PB basis sets the even tempered 10s10p10d10f"
" to 12s12p12d12f12g basis sets are recommended."
msgstr ""
"核子系统的密度拟合基组通过 ``nucfit`` 关键词定义。为了避免经典核的基组分配出现问题，默认基组必须分配为 ``neo-basis``\\ "
"。之后，所有 NEO 中心必须分配相同的拟合基组（基组库中已包含两个），或者必须定义一个新的基组。对于 PB 基组的拟合，推荐使用均匀调和的 "
"10s10p10d10f 到 12s12p12d12f12g 基组。"

msgid "NEO centers"
msgstr "NEO 中心"

msgid ""
"The desired NEO centers must be declared immediately before the NEO "
"computation explicitly via"
msgstr "所需的 NEO 中心必须在 NEO 计算之前立即通过以下方式显式声明"

msgid ""
"Additionally, the chosen quantum mechanical nuclei must be given as first "
"atoms in the geometry definition as shown for a water molecule below"
msgstr "此外，选定的量子力学核必须在几何定义中作为前几个原子给出，如下方水分子示例所示"

msgid "Starting options"
msgstr "起始选项"

msgid ""
"In order to provide suitable starting orbitals for the NEO computation three"
" options can be chosen."
msgstr "为了给NEO计算提供合适的起始轨道，可以选择三种选项。"

msgid ""
"The second option is especially beneficial for large systems, since the "
"computational costs of a prior RHF calculation is avoided. One makes use of "
"the natural orbitals from a diagonal density matrix constructed using atomic"
" orbitals. Atomic occupation numbers are employed as electronic starting "
"orbitals. This option can be used via the ``NEOATDEN`` keyword in the NEO "
"program input card. This is only available in NEO-RHF."
msgstr ""
"第二种选项对于大体系尤其有益，因为它避免了先前RHF计算的计算成本。该方法利用由原子轨道构建的对角密度矩阵的自然轨道。原子占据数被用作电子起始轨道。此选项可以通过NEO程序输入卡中的"
" ``NEOATDEN`` 关键字使用。这仅在NEO-RHF中可用。"

msgid "Thresholds"
msgstr "阈值"

msgid ""
"The thresholds for the NEO computation can be adjusted with the following "
"keywords"
msgstr "NEO计算的阈值可以通过以下关键字进行调整"

msgid ""
"For robust convergence it is recommended to use higher thresholds for the "
"SCF computations of both subsystems than the overall NEO energy."
msgstr "为确保稳健收敛，建议将两个子系统SCF计算的阈值设置得高于整体NEO能量阈值。"

msgid "Additional options"
msgstr "附加选项"

msgid ""
"``NOBLOCKDIAG`` disables the block diagonalization of the nuclear starting "
"guess (this is generally not recommended!!)"
msgstr "``NOBLOCKDIAG`` 禁用核起始猜测的块对角化（通常不推荐使用！！）"

msgid ""
"``NEOMIXBAS`` enables the use of user-defined mixed basis sets (see example "
"for use)"
msgstr "``NEOMIXBAS`` 启用用户定义的混合基组（参见使用示例）"

msgid "Adaptive NEO"
msgstr "自适应 NEO"

msgid ""
"Optimization of quantum nuclei positions with the adaptive NEO approach, "
"where the nuclear centroids are computed on-the-fly during the SCF "
"iterations. This procedure is available by using the"
msgstr "使用自适应 NEO 方法优化量子核位置，其中核质心在 SCF 迭代过程中实时计算。此过程可通过在 NEO 程序输入卡中使用"

msgid ""
"keyword in the NEO program input card. This approach is so far only "
"available for NEO-RHF calculations."
msgstr "关键字实现。该方法目前仅适用于 NEO-RHF 计算。"

msgid "Threshold"
msgstr "阈值"

msgid ""
"The thresholds for the convergence criteria of the nuclear centers during an"
" adaptive NEO computation can be adjusted with the following keyword"
msgstr "自适应 NEO 计算期间核中心收敛准则的阈值可通过以下关键字进行调整"

msgid "Damping"
msgstr "阻尼"

msgid ""
"The shift of the nuclear basis function center towards the charge centroid "
"can be damped with the following keyword"
msgstr "核基函数中心向电荷质心的偏移可以通过以下关键词进行阻尼处理"

msgid "NEO examples"
msgstr "NEO 示例"

msgid ""
"The first example shows the input of a ``DF-NEO-RHF`` calculation for a "
"water molecule with two NEO centers starting with the ``NEOATDEN`` option "
"and individual thresholds."
msgstr ""
"第一个示例展示了从 ``NEOATDEN`` 选项和单独阈值开始，对具有两个 NEO 中心的水分子进行 ``DF-NEO-RHF`` 计算的输入。"

msgid ""
"The second example shows the input of a ``DF-NEO-RKS`` calculation. The grid"
" used is ``SG3``, with the B3LYP functional used for the electron-electron "
"exchange-correlation and epc17.2 for the electron-proton correlation."
msgstr ""
"第二个示例展示了 ``DF-NEO-RKS`` 计算的输入。使用的格点为 ``SG3``\\ ，电子-电子交换相关使用 B3LYP 泛函，电子-"
"质子相关使用 epc17.2。"

msgid ""
"The following example shows a NEO calculation, where a user-defined mixed "
"basis set is used. Thereby, the electronic basis set at the quantum nuclei "
"is larger than for regular hydrogen atoms. The use of the ``NEOMIXBAS`` "
"requires the additional definition of the ``elebas`` and ``elefit`` basis "
"sets as shown below."
msgstr ""
"以下示例展示了一个 NEO 计算，其中使用了用户自定义的混合基组。因此，量子核处的电子基组比常规氢原子处的更大。使用 ``NEOMIXBAS`` "
"需要额外定义 ``elebas`` 和 ``elefit`` 基组，如下所示。"

msgid ""
"The example below shows the input for an adaptive NEO calculation, where the"
" nuclear basis function centers convergence is set below 1E-5 bohr and a "
"damping factor of 0.5 is applied."
msgstr "以下示例展示了一个自适应 NEO 计算的输入，其中核基函数中心收敛性设置为低于 1E-5 玻尔，并应用了 0.5 的阻尼因子。"

